# Deny all, then allowlist back. Keeps the build context minimal and
# avoids accidentally shipping repo-local state into the image.

# --- Ignore everything ---
**

# --- Allowlist: Python sources (the package) ---
!data_validation/
!third_party/

# --- Allowlist: build configuration ---
!setup.py
!setup.cfg
!README.md

# --- Allowlist: license/attribution ---
!LICENSE

# --- Deny, even within allowlisted dirs (caches, VCS, junk) ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
